            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Solomoni aloma ali,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio omwami Solomoni ayukha mala abiita libuusiana lioosi lia Isiraeli chikhabi. Libuusiana lino lioosi liaba liemile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.7.1+2SA.7.2+2SA.7.3+2SA.7.4+2SA.7.5+2SA.7.6+2SA.7.7+2SA.7.8+2SA.7.9+2SA.7.10+2SA.7.11+2SA.7.12+2SA.7.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam. 7.1-13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.17.1+1CH.17.2+1CH.17.3+1CH.17.4+1CH.17.5+1CH.17.6+1CH.17.7+1CH.17.8+1CH.17.9+1CH.17.10+1CH.17.11+1CH.17.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Ke Ch. 17.1-12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Aloma ali, “Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi afume, Wele owa Isiraeli okholile niko alaka paapa wase Daudi. Aboola ali, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Khukhwama khu ndaalo niyo nareereramo babaandu base, khukhwama mu sibala sia Misiri, se narobora lukoba mu kholo cha Isiraeli choosi nimwo nombakha enju niio basaayila tawe. Ne se narobora omundu nga omwimeelesi owe babaandu base Isiraeli tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali narobora Yerusalemu niio saayilwa, mala narobora Daudi amiie babaandu base Isiraeli.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Solomoni achiililila ali, “Nono paapa wase Daudi enya khukhwombakha enju eye khusaayilamo Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele owa Isiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali, Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aboolela paapa wase Daudi ali, ‘Wenya khu khunjombakhila enju mu lisina liase, lilienya liowo liaba lilayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhaba kario ewe se olombakha enju yino tawe. Ne kakhali omusoleeli wowo, niye ewe okhasaale, niye okhombakhe enju mwisina liase.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Luno, Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi echusie niko alaka, sikila ese nemile mu bweyaangu bwa paapa wase Daudi. Nekhaale khu ndebe eye bubwami bwa Isiraeli, nga Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi ne alaka. Ne nombakhe enju mwisina lia Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele owa Isiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne mubwenomwo, narereemo Lisanduku lie ndakaano, nimwo endakaano eya Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi niyo akhola ne Baisiraeli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lisaba lia Solomoni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Solomoni eema ebweeni wa alutare eya Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, ebweeni we libuusiana lioosi lia Isiraeli. Asuta kamakhono kewe mu ngaaki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomoni aba akhola situumi sie kumukasa; siaba sialekhaana buleeyi ne bukhiikha, buleeyi bikele biraano ne bukhiikha bwosi bikele biraano. Ne khucha angaaki bwaba bifuba bitaru. Solomoni aasira khu luya mala asimakho. Nio asikama ebweeni we libuusiana lioosi lia Isiraeli mala asuta kamakhono kewe mu ngaaki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne asaba ali, “Ee Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele owa Isiraeli, se aliio Wele nga ewe, mwikulu namwe khu sibala tawe. Se aliio oliindanga endakaano ne khukhwekesia busiime bwa mindali na mindali khu bakholi bowo bamenya ebweeni wowo ne kimiooyo kiabwe kioosi tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ewe wakhola niko walaka omukholi wowo Daudi, paapa wase. Ewe walomaloma ne kumunwa kwowo, mala ne kamaani kowo wakakholile endaalo eya luno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.2.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bab. 2.4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Khwako luno, Ee Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele owa Isiraeli, liinda lisuubisia liliindi nilio walaka omukholi wowo Daudi, paapa wase. Waloma oli, ‘Se alitambao omundu khukhwama munju yowo owikhala khu ndebe eye bubwami bwa Isiraeli tawe. Lino lilekholekha, baaba bali basoleeli bowo beyaya khu ngila yabwe khukeendela mu lilaka liase nga ewe ne wakeenda ebweeni wase.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khwako luno, Ee Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele owa Isiraeli, lekha elomo yowo niyo ewe walomaloma khu mukholi wowo Daudi ebe erio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.2.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ke Ch. 2.6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Ne kakhali Wele, ng'ali ewe olamenya ne babaandu khu liloba ku? Lola, likulu, ne mwikulu mwe angaaki lukali se linyala liakhwoola tawe. Ne Lukaangu nilwo ese nombakhe luno lukhwola luriena! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rekeeresia lisaba lio omukholi wowo ne lilieloocha liewe, Ee Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wase. Rekeeresia liilila ne lisaba nilio omukholi wowo asaba ebweeni wowo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.12.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Likh. 12.11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Chimoni chowo chibona, kumuusi ne siilo, chibone enju yino niyo ewe warobora ebe eye khu khusaayilamo ewe. Ne rekeeresia lisaba nilio omukholi wowo asabila abuundu ano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rekeeresia lilieloocha lio mukholi wowo, ne lie babaandu bowo Isiraeli, nga ne basabila mu Lukaangu luno. Ee, ewe ulila ne oli mwikulu nimwo omenyile, mala nga ne oulila khubeele.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omundu ne akholela owasie kamamayaanu alikholwa echube, ebweeni we alutare mu Lukaangu luno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio ulila ne oli mwikulu mala okhole, ne khukhalakila bakholi bowo. Khalakila niye kumusaango kukwolaana, khulwe khumuelesia niye omwene kumunaanio, ne babila omuluungi khulwe khumuruunga khuloondekhana ne buluungi bwewe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Babaandu bowo Baisiraeli balikhilwa ebweeni wo omusiku baaba ne bakholile bubwoni khwiwe. Ne baaba ne bakobola lundi bafukiilila lisina liowo mala basaba ne khukhwiloochela ewe mu Lukaangu muno, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ulila khukhwama mwikulu mala obabeele bubwoni bwabwe. Ne bakobosie lundi mu sibala nisio ewe wabaelesia nibo ne bakuuka babwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Efula ekhalekhe khukwa, baaba ne bakhukholele ewe bubwoni. Ne baaba ne basaba ne baloleleele abuundu ano mala bafukiilila lisina liowo mala balekha bubwoni bwabwe, nga ewe ne olibaa kumunaanio, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ulila khukhwama mwikulu mala ababeele bubwoni bwe bakholi bowo, babaandu bowo ba Isiraeli. Bekesie chingila chindayi nicho bakhoyela khu keendamo, mala ofukiilile efula ekwe khu maloba niko ewe waelesia babaandu bowo nga kumukabwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Biise bibiindi enjala eliba mu sibala namwe lufu namwe kumuumu namwe chisike, namwe chikhungu. Ne biise bibiindi nabio, basiku balibebwaakala mu lukoba lwabwe lwosi lwosi, namwe lulibao lufu, namwe bulwaale bwosi bwosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Butinyu buno ne bubechakho mala ne basaba lisaba liosi liosi ne lilieloocha lio omundu yesi yesi namwe ne babaandu bowo Isiraeli boosi ulila. Ne basaba, buli mundu ne amanyile buchuuni bwewe ne bubeeleli bwewe, mala ne asuta kamakhono kewe mu ngaaki mu Lukaangu luno, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ulila khukhwama mwikulu nimwo wamenya. Babeele, mala okholeele buli mulala, niye ewe omanyile kumwoyo kwewe, khuloondekhana ne chingila chewe. (Sikila ewe, ewe weng'ene omanyile kimiooyo kie babaandu). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khola orio nio boole khukhuria ewe mala bakeende mu ngila chowo chindaalo choosi nicho bamenya mu sibala nisio ewe waelesia bakuuka befwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Lundi omukeni okhali owe babaandu bowo Baisiraeli tawe, aliicha khukhwama mu sibala sie aleeyi sikila lisina liowo lili liboofu ne bunyali bwowo, bukali ne buaani bwowo bukali. Ne aliicha asabile mu Lukaangu muno, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ulila khukhwama mwikulu nimwo wamenya. Ne kholela omukeni oyo koosi khuloondekhana nende niko akhusaba. Nio babaandu be mu sibala boosi boole khumanya lisina liowo mala bakhurie, nga babaandu bowo Baisiraeli ne bakholanga. Nio buli mundu alimanya Lukaangu nilwo ese nombaakhe luno, ali luli lwe khukhusaayilamo ewe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Babaandu bowo barirura khucha mwiie khu khuupana ne basiku babwe, mu ngila yosi yosi niyo ewe okhabarumiremo. Ne basaba ewe ne baloleleele lukoba nilwo ewe warobora luno, ne Lukaangu nilwo ese nombakhe khukhwisaayilamo ewe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ulila khukhwama mwikulu lisaba liabwe ne lilieloocha liabwe mala obaelesie bukhili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Baba ne bakhola bubwoni (Sikila se aliio omundu okhakholanga bubwoni tawe) Ne ewe olibakhalalila mala abaane khu musiku, babukulwe nga baboe babayile mu sibala sie aleeyi namwe aembi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali balibaasia mu mwoyo ne bali mu sibala nisio bayilwamo nga baboe mala bebiiye. Balikhwikoonjelela ne bali mu sibala sie embaambe siabwe bali, ‘Efwe khwakholile bumayaanu. Khwakholile ke sifwaabi ne bumayaanu.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lundi baba ne bekanila ne kamebaasio kabwe koosi ne kumwoyo kwabwe kwoosi ne bali mu sibala sie embaambe siabwe nimwo bayilwa nga baboe. Balisaba ne baloleleele sibala siabwe, nisio ewe waelesia bakuuka babwe, lukoba nilwo ewe warobora ne nju niyo ese nombakhe khulwe lisina liowo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio baulile khukhwama mwikulu abuundu a bumenyo bwowo. Ulila lisaba liabwe ne lilieloocha liabwe. Bayeete mala obeele babaandu bowo bakhukholeele ewe bubwoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nono, Ee, Wele wase, lekha chimoni chowo chibone ne kamaru kowo karekeeresie lisaba lie abuundu ano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
